{"id":"e75dc86b680683eb","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lambda-complete-development.md","title":"λ 项的完全展开","display":"df-lambda-complete-development — λ 项的完全展开","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-lambda-complete-development","aliases":["56-df-lambda-complete-development"],"display":"df-lambda-complete-development — λ 项的完全展开","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), construction in proof of Proposition 10.2.4, printed p556","source_ocr_block":"577","source_status":"source-construction-and-proof-read"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lambda-complete-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lambda-complete-development</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-complete-development — λ 项的完全展开"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), construction in proof of Proposition 10.2.4, printed p556"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"577"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-construction-and-proof-read"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a> 的无常元无类型实例，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)\">\\(L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P\\in L\">\\(M,N,P\\in L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\Lambda\">\\(m\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L\">\\(\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L\\)</span> 按有限原始项树递归；替换取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a> 的原始项函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Dev}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda x.\\operatorname{Dev}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dev}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Dev}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda x.\\operatorname{Dev}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}((\\lambda x.P)N)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dev}(P)[x:=\\operatorname{Dev}(N)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dev}((\\lambda x.P)N)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dev}(P)[x:=\\operatorname{Dev}(N)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}(MN)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\n\\qquad\\bigl(M\\notin\\{\\lambda x.P:x\\in V,\\ P\\in L\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dev}(MN)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\n\\qquad\\bigl(M\\notin\\{\\lambda x.P:x\\in V,\\ P\\in L\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M,N\\in L\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\equiv_\\alpha\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M,N\\in L\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\equiv_\\alpha\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{([M]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{Dev}(M)]_\\alpha):M\\in L\\},\n\\qquad D_\\alpha:\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m^\\star\\coloneqq D_\\alpha(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{([M]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{Dev}(M)]_\\alpha):M\\in L\\},\n\\qquad D_\\alpha:\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m^\\star\\coloneqq D_\\alpha(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 10.2.4 证明中的构造（印刷 p556，OCR 页块577）。递归均作用于严格较小子项；替换输出按 α 等价识别，故改名不会改变结果。它是同时展开原有 β redex 的构造，不承诺输出已经是 β 正规形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无常元无类型实例，令 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$M,N,P\\in L$、$x\\in V$，$m\\in\\Lambda$。$\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L$ 按有限原始项树递归；替换取 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的原始项函数。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无常元无类型实例，令 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$M,N,P\\in L$、$x\\in V$，$m\\in\\Lambda$。$\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L$ 按有限原始项树递归；替换取 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的原始项函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,P\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Dev}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda x.\\operatorname{Dev}(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}((\\lambda x.P)N)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dev}(P)[x:=\\operatorname{Dev}(N)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}(MN)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\n\\qquad\\bigl(M\\notin\\{\\lambda x.P:x\\in V,\\ P\\in L\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall M,N\\in L\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Dev}(M)\\equiv_\\alpha\\operatorname{Dev}(N)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{([M]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{Dev}(M)]_\\alpha):M\\in L\\},\n\\qquad D_\\alpha:\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m^\\star\\coloneqq D_\\alpha(m).","display":true}],"bytes":1876,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-complete-development.md]]"},{"id":"52fbf9496f872506","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$M,N\\in\\Lambda$。同时归约 $\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 与完全展开 $(-)^\\star$ 见 [[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]；根收缩所需的同时替换接口见 [[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]。"}],"outgoing":["96add5833bb7dcac","752f53ceb23d931c"]}